{
  "pedal": "Boss CS-3 Compression Sustainer (mono)",
  "comment": "Analog (1986): a uPC1252H2 VCA, op-amps M5218L/BA718; a transistor peak detector (4.7 uF / 1 MOhm: release up to seconds). Pots: Level 50k audio, Tone 20k linear, Attack 250k (in the detector), Sustain 20k linear. Manual: Level fully counter-clockwise mutes; Sustain counter-clockwise = a limiter, clockwise = more sustain (may hiss or howl near the top); Attack clockwise keeps the pick's attack; Tone clockwise brighter. Nominal input and output -20 dBu. Knobs at 12:00 unless a take says otherwise. Clock positions: 7:00 = fully counter-clockwise, 5:00 = fully clockwise.",
